! f12-home -- make F12 act as Home.
!
! For keyboards with no physical Home key. Keycode 96 is F12 on standard X
! keymaps; verify yours with `xmodmap -pke | grep ' = F12'` before trusting it.
!
! Home is repeated across all shift levels on purpose. A single `= Home` leaves
! the shifted levels NoSymbol, which breaks Shift+F12 (select to line start)
! and Ctrl+Shift+F12 (select to document start).

keycode 96 = Home Home Home Home Home Home
